<section class="hero tw-overflow-hidden tw-bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,#fff_0%,#fff_56%,#f1f5fa_100%)]"><div class="wrap hero-grid tw-grid tw-min-h-[560px] tw-grid-cols-2 tw-items-center tw-gap-[60px] tw-pt-[48px] tw-pb-[52px] max-[1000px]:tw-grid-cols-1 max-[640px]:tw-pt-[42px] max-[640px]:tw-pb-[42px]"><div><div class="eyebrow">Ultima Series</div><h1>Time Clocks Built to Fit Your Workforce</h1><h2>Flexible. Modular. Powerful.</h2><p>Choose the screen, authentication, connectivity, power and environmental protection that fit each workforce.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn secondary" href="#compare">Compare All Models <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class="family"><img alt="ZKTeco WFM Ultima 5, Ultima 7, Ultima 7P and Ultima 10 time clocks" src="assets/Hero-Ultima-Series.png?v=ultima-hero-v3"/></div></div></section><div class="quicknav"><div class="wrap"><a href="#ultima10">Ultima 10</a><a href="#ultima7">Ultima 7</a><a href="#compare">Model Comparison</a><a href="#configuration">Configuration Options</a><a href="#ultima7p">Ultima 7P</a><a href="#ultima5">Ultima 5</a></div></div>
<section id="models"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Designed Around Your Requirements</div><h2>One Platform<br/>The Right Clock for Each Workforce</h2><p>One Ultima platform spans different screens, credentials, biometrics, connectivity and environments—without changing the workforce data strategy.</p></div><div class="models tw-grid tw-grid-cols-4 tw-gap-[18px] max-[1000px]:tw-grid-cols-2 max-[640px]:tw-grid-cols-1"><article class="model-card tw-flex tw-min-h-[510px] tw-flex-col tw-rounded-[18px] tw-border tw-border-[var(--line)] tw-bg-white tw-p-[22px] tw-shadow-[0_12px_34px_rgba(20,25,70,.07)]"><div class="model-image"><img alt="Ultima 10 time clock" src="assets/Ultima%2010%20image.png"/></div><div class="model-kicker">More Screen. More Interaction.</div><h3>Ultima 10</h3><p>A larger 10-inch interface for schedules, job or labor selections, attestations, messages and richer employee interaction at the clock.</p><div class="facts"><div class="fact">10-inch touchscreen</div><div class="fact">Broad biometric &amp; credential options</div><div class="fact">Wi-Fi + Ethernet + optional 4G LTE</div><div class="fact">Designed for richer workflows</div><div class="fact">Same Ultima platform</div></div><div class="card-actions"><a class="text-link green" href="#ultima10">Full Details →</a></div></article><article class="model-card tw-flex tw-min-h-[510px] tw-flex-col tw-rounded-[18px] tw-border tw-border-[var(--line)] tw-bg-white tw-p-[22px] tw-shadow-[0_12px_34px_rgba(20,25,70,.07)]"><div class="model-image"><img alt="Ultima 7P rugged portable time clock" src="assets/Ultima%207p%20image.png"/></div><div class="model-kicker">Rugged. Portable. Ready.</div><h3>Ultima 7P</h3><p>The 7-inch Ultima experience with rugged protection and portable deployment for environments where a traditional indoor clock is not enough.</p><div class="facts"><div class="fact">7-inch touchscreen</div><div class="fact">IP66 water &amp; dust resistance</div><div class="fact">4G LTE + Wi-Fi + Ethernet</div><div class="fact">High-capacity battery</div><div class="fact">Portable or fixed deployment</div></div><div class="card-actions"><a class="text-link green" href="#ultima7p">Full Details →</a></div></article><article class="model-card tw-flex tw-min-h-[510px] tw-flex-col tw-rounded-[18px] tw-border tw-border-[var(--line)] tw-bg-white tw-p-[22px] tw-shadow-[0_12px_34px_rgba(20,25,70,.07)] featured tw-relative tw-border-2 tw-border-[var(--green)]"><span class="badge">Most Flexible</span><div class="model-image"><img alt="Ultima 7 time clock" src="assets/Ultima%207%20image.png"/></div><div class="model-kicker">Versatile. Flexible. Proven.</div><h3>Ultima 7</h3><p>More screen space and configuration flexibility for schedules, job or labor selection, attestations and broader employee workflows.</p><div class="facts"><div class="fact">7-inch touchscreen</div><div class="fact">Broad biometric &amp; credential options</div><div class="fact">Wi-Fi + Ethernet</div><div class="fact">Flexible power options</div><div class="fact">Strong all-around deployment fit</div></div><div class="card-actions"><a class="text-link green" href="#ultima7">Full Details →</a></div></article><article class="model-card tw-flex tw-min-h-[510px] tw-flex-col tw-rounded-[18px] tw-border tw-border-[var(--line)] tw-bg-white tw-p-[22px] tw-shadow-[0_12px_34px_rgba(20,25,70,.07)]"><div class="model-image"><img alt="Ultima 5 time clock" src="assets/Ultima%205%20G3%20image.png"/></div><div class="model-kicker">Compact. Full Capability.</div><h3>Ultima 5</h3><p>Full Ultima capability in a smaller footprint—ideal for straightforward time and labor data collection when a larger screen is not a priority.</p><div class="facts"><div class="fact">5-inch touchscreen</div><div class="fact">Flexible biometric &amp; credential options</div><div class="fact">Wi-Fi + Ethernet</div><div class="fact">Optional PoE+</div><div class="fact">Same Ultima platform</div></div><div class="card-actions"><a class="text-link green" href="#ultima5">Full Details →</a></div></article></div></div></section>
