<section class="mist model-details"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Model Details</div><h2>Choose the Right Ultima Faster</h2><p>Each model supports the same workforce data collection strategy while addressing a different physical environment and employee interaction need.</p></div>
<div class="detail" id="ultima5"><div aria-label="Ultima 5 product images" class="device-panel ultima-carousel"><button aria-label="Previous Ultima 5 image" class="ultima-carousel-control is-prev" type="button"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 4 7 12l8 8"/></svg></button><div class="ultima-carousel-viewport"><img alt="Ultima 5 front view" class="is-active" src="assets/5_1.png"/><img alt="Ultima 5 angled front view" src="assets/5_2.png"/><img alt="Ultima 5 angled rear view" src="assets/5_3.png"/><img alt="Ultima 5 rear view" src="assets/5_4.png"/><img alt="Ultima 5 side view" src="assets/5_5.png"/><img alt="Ultima 5 opposite side view" src="assets/5_6.png"/><img alt="Ultima 5 top view" src="assets/5_7.png"/></div><button aria-label="Next Ultima 5 image" class="ultima-carousel-control is-next" type="button"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 4l8 8-8 8"/></svg></button></div><div class="detail-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Ultima 5</div><h3>Compact. Full Capability.</h3><h4>Best fit: straightforward clocking and workforce data collection where a larger screen is not a priority.</h4><p>Ultima 5 fits straightforward clocking and lighter employee workflows in a compact footprint.</p><div class="spec-chips"><span class="chip">5-inch Touchscreen</span><span class="chip">Compact Footprint</span><span class="chip">Android OS</span><span class="chip">Wi-Fi</span><span class="chip">Ethernet</span><span class="chip">Optional PoE+</span><span class="chip">Flexible Credentials</span></div><div class="detail-grid"><div><strong>Screen &amp; Experience</strong>5-inch touchscreen for straightforward clocking and workforce data collection when a larger display is not required.</div><div><strong>Authentication</strong>Fingerprint, face, palm and supported card, NFC and QR credential options by configuration.</div><div><strong>Connectivity &amp; Power</strong>Ethernet and Wi-Fi connectivity with 12V AC and optional PoE+ power configurations.</div><div><strong>Deployment</strong>Compact footprint for locations where space matters without giving up the Ultima platform.</div></div><a class="btn secondary" href="assets/Ext_U5-Datasheet_2026_v3.2-USP.pdf" download>Download Datasheet</a></div></div><a class="btn secondary" href="assets/Ext_U5-Datasheet_2026_v3.2-USP.pdf" download>Download Datasheet</a><div class="detail reverse" id="ultima7"><div aria-label="Ultima 7 product images" class="device-panel ultima-carousel"><button aria-label="Previous Ultima 7 image" class="ultima-carousel-control is-prev" type="button"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 4 7 12l8 8"/></svg></button><div class="ultima-carousel-viewport"><img alt="Ultima 7 front view" class="is-active" src="assets/7_1.png"/><img alt="Ultima 7 angled front view" src="assets/7_2.png"/><img alt="Ultima 7 angled rear view" src="assets/7_3.png"/><img alt="Ultima 7 rear view" src="assets/7_4.png"/><img alt="Ultima 7 alternate front view" src="assets/7_5.png"/><img alt="Ultima 7 side view" src="assets/7_6.png"/><img alt="Ultima 7 opposite side view" src="assets/7_7.png"/></div><button aria-label="Next Ultima 7 image" class="ultima-carousel-control is-next" type="button"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 4l8 8-8 8"/></svg></button></div><div class="detail-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Ultima 7</div><h3>Versatile. Flexible. Proven.</h3><h4>Best fit: when employees need more screen space for schedules, job or labor selection, attestations and broader workflows.</h4><p>Ultima 7 provides a balanced 7-inch employee interface with broad configuration flexibility. It is a strong all-around choice when the clock needs to support more than a basic punch while remaining practical for wide deployment across many locations.</p><div class="spec-chips"><span class="chip">7-inch Touchscreen</span><span class="chip">8-Core Processor</span><span class="chip">2 GB RAM / 16 GB Storage</span><span class="chip">Android OS</span><span class="chip">Wi-Fi</span><span class="chip">Ethernet</span><span class="chip">Flexible Configuration</span></div><div class="detail-grid"><div><strong>Screen &amp; Experience</strong>7-inch touchscreen with more room for schedules, job or labor selection, attestations and broader employee workflows.</div><div><strong>Authentication</strong>Fingerprint, facial recognition, palm, cards, NFC, QR/barcode and other supported credential options.</div><div><strong>Workflows</strong>Well suited to schedules, job transfers, labor-code selection, attestations, messages and other employee interactions.</div><div><strong>Deployment</strong>A versatile choice when organizations want one broadly applicable model across many workforce environments.</div></div><a class="btn secondary" href="assets/Ext_U7-Datasheet_2026_v3.2-USP.pdf" download>Download Data Sheet</a></div></div><div class="detail" id="ultima7p"><div aria-label="Ultima 7P product images" class="device-panel ultima-carousel"><button aria-label="Previous Ultima 7P image" class="ultima-carousel-control is-prev" type="button"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 4 7 12l8 8"/></svg></button><div class="ultima-carousel-viewport"><img alt="Ultima 7P product view 1" class="is-active" src="assets/7p_1.png"/><img alt="Ultima 7P product view 2" src="assets/7p_2.png"/><img alt="Ultima 7P product view 3" src="assets/7p_3.png"/><img alt="Ultima 7P product view 4" src="assets/7p_4.png"/><img alt="Ultima 7P product view 5" src="assets/7p_5.png"/><img alt="Ultima 7P product view 6" src="assets/7p_6.png"/></div><button aria-label="Next Ultima 7P image" class="ultima-carousel-control is-next" type="button"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 4l8 8-8 8"/></svg></button></div><div class="detail-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Ultima 7P</div><h3>Rugged. Portable. Ready.</h3><h4>Best fit: when you need the 7-inch experience plus ruggedness, portability or additional environmental protection.</h4><p>Ultima 7P extends the Ultima platform into demanding workforce environments. Its IP66-rated enclosure and portable deployment capability make it the right choice when dust, water exposure, mobility or non-traditional mounting requirements are part of the deployment.</p><div class="spec-chips"><span class="chip">7-inch Touchscreen</span><span class="chip">IP66 Rated</span><span class="chip">Portable or Fixed</span><span class="chip">Battery Option</span><span class="chip">Wi-Fi</span><span class="chip">Ethernet</span><span class="chip">4G LTE Option</span></div><div class="detail-grid"><div><strong>Screen &amp; Experience</strong>7-inch touchscreen with the interaction space of Ultima 7 in a rugged, portable form factor.</div><div><strong>Rugged Design</strong>IP66-rated protection against dust and water, designed for demanding environments and portable or fixed use.</div><div><strong>Connectivity &amp; Power</strong>Ethernet, dual-band Wi-Fi and 4G LTE options, with 12V AC, PoE+ and high-capacity battery configurations.</div><div><strong>Deployment</strong>Best when ruggedness, portability, battery operation or added environmental protection is required.</div></div><a class="btn secondary" href="assets/Ext_U7P-Datasheet_2026_v3.2-USP.pdf" download>Download Datasheet</a></div></div><div class="detail reverse" id="ultima10"><div aria-label="Ultima 10 product images" class="device-panel ultima-carousel"><button aria-label="Previous Ultima 10 image" class="ultima-carousel-control is-prev" type="button"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 4 7 12l8 8"/></svg></button><div class="ultima-carousel-viewport"><img alt="Ultima 10 product view 1" class="is-active" src="assets/10_1.png"/><img alt="Ultima 10 product view 2" src="assets/10_2.png"/><img alt="Ultima 10 product view 3" src="assets/10_3.png"/><img alt="Ultima 10 product view 4" src="assets/10_4.png"/><img alt="Ultima 10 product view 5" src="assets/10_5.png"/><img alt="Ultima 10 product view 6" src="assets/10_6.